STATBAG version 1

April 28 1998.

General statistical routines.

INSTALLATION
------------

Put these routines in a directory DIRNAME and then put
that directory on you MATLABPATH and PATH 
unix environment variables. Set this up
in your .login file.

It is important that both MATLABPATH and PATH
are set up correctly.

Then, in Matlab, type help DIRNAME (just the last bit, not
the full path) to see an overview of what functions
are available.


C-CODE
------

Two of the routines; forward and forwards use a C-executable
called forward.

The source for this is available separately in the package SFS.

